#  * src/android/pch.h (the Visual Studio project force-included it) is force-included in C++ files: JNI, EGL, the asset manager,
#    the app glue, g_androidState. It included the OpenGL ES 1 header; now GLES2.
#  * ALooper_pollAll is gone from current NDKs: ALooper_pollOnce(0, ...) in the same loop. std::bind of AndroidWindow::openUrl bound
#    a copy of the window (does not compile); it binds the pointer.
#  * ResourceManager::encrypt is declared and named by main.cpp but was compiled out on Android: an empty definition (link error).
#  * logcat tag "CindersOfChaos".
# Compiled and linked (libraries stubbed) with NDK r27d, android-26, arm64-v8a: no engine symbol is left undefined. Not run on a device.
